            "title": "What's Actually<strong> in the Bottle</strong>",
            "title_highlight_color": "#47b5e9",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_JVGtNh": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Lauryl Glucoside</strong> — a gentle, plant-derived cleanser that lifts dirt without stripping the skin.<br/><strong>PEG-7 Glyceryl Cocoate </strong>— a mild coconut-derived cleansing agent.<br/><strong>PEG-6 Caprylic/Capric Glycerides</strong> — helps the formula rinse-free and non-greasy.<br/><strong>Glycerin </strong>— draws in moisture to help prevent dryness.<br/><strong>Amino Acid Humectan</strong>t — helps the skin retain moisture after cleansing.<br/><strong>Witch Hazel Extract </strong>— a soothing plant extract.<br/><strong>Cucumber Extract</strong> — a soothing, hydrating plant extract.<br/><strong>Benzalkonium Chloride </strong>— included at a low concentration to help keep the formula clean and support hygienic use.<br/><strong>Phenoxyethanol </strong>— a preservative that keeps the formula stable over time.<br/><strong>EDI Purified Water</strong> — the base of the formula.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
